            "君は除く"
          ]
        ],
        "lead": "えこひいきに、理屈なんてない。"
      },
      "zh": {
        "title": "你除外",
        "stanzas": [
          [
            "我的原則很多",
            "第一條",
            "不等人",
            "第二條",
            "不熬夜",
            "第三條",
            "不吃別人碗裡的東西"
          ],
          [
            "你把咬了一口的麵包",
            "遞過來",
            "我開心地把它吃完"
          ],
          [
            "原來每一條原則",
            "只是在等",
            "一個特例"
          ],
          [
            "所以每一條原則",
            "我都偷偷補了一行",
            "你除外"
          ]
        ],
        "lead": "偏心本來就不講道理。"
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "Except You",
        "stanzas": [
          [
            "I have a lot of rules",
            "Number one",
            "I don’t wait for anyone",
            "Number two",
            "I don’t stay up late",
            "Number three",
            "I don’t eat off other people’s plates"
          ],
          [
            "You held out a piece of bread",
            "you’d already bitten into",
            "and I happily ate it all"
          ],
          [
            "Turns out every rule",
            "was only waiting",
            "for one exception"
          ],
          [
            "so under every rule",
            "I quietly added a line",
            "except you"
          ]
        ],
        "lead": "Playing favorites was never fair."
      }
